==English==

==={{abbreviation}}===
'''f.'''

# and the following (page, paragraph, etc.)

====Usage notes====
The abbreviation {{term||f.}} is used in a citation to refer to a section for which no final number can usefully be given. When used, {{term||f.}} has no space between it and the preceding number and is followed by a period.  If more than one following section is meant, {{term|ff.}} is used.

====Synonyms====
* [[et seq.]]
* [[ff.]]

